ng>Customize and upgrade</strong> your vehicle to make it even more absurd and powerful </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get loot</strong>... a lot of loot </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generated tracks</strong> with JunkPunk elements </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427070/extras/63fbf141b20111dcfe94209937906d6d.poster.avif?t=1753969638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427070/extras/63fbf141b20111dcfe94209937906d6d.webm?t=1753969638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427070/extras/63fbf141b20111dcfe94209937906d6d.mp4?t=1753969638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i> </p>",
